      "message": "Does it make sense to extend usb_mux_driver structure to include a .chipset_reset or .reset member that allows the MUX drivers to take action on chipset reset? Then we don\u0027t really need to duplicate usb_mux in baseboard/zork/baseboard.c. Also, the call to reset will happen from usb_mux driver. So, boards won\u0027t have to take any special action.",
